# Day 29 – Operation Lifeline: Supply Chain Crisis Lab

## Overview

Today I built an interactive enterprise business simulation called **Operation Lifeline: Supply Chain Crisis Lab** using Claude AI.

The simulator allows users to experience how enterprise leaders manage real-world supply chain disruptions through strategic decision-making.

---

## Features

- Welcome dashboard
- Random company generation
- Dynamic supply chain crisis scenarios
- War Room decision engine
- Supplier negotiation simulator
- CEO leadership assessment
- AI investment strategy selection
- Executive analytics dashboard
- Replay with randomized scenarios
- Responsive enterprise UI

---

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- React (CDN)
- Babel JSX

